Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Wyckoff, layer-group, and rod-group databases", "TechNoteSection",ExpressionUUID->"14983533-d776-49e1-ae88-97b0f1dadfd1"],

Cell["\<\
The symmetry databases can also be used on their own. showMSGWyckoff lists \
the representative positions and allowed moments of a magnetic space group. \
mlgop and mrgop give the operations of magnetic layer groups and magnetic rod \
groups, respectively.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"4aad7b60-e7cd-4192-b803-5a20baba6fdb"],

