Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Changing the symmetry in version 2.0", "TechNoteSection",ExpressionUUID->"e2eea793-154d-4c65-b8f9-996c53173c19"],

Cell["\<\
To lower the symmetry, change the model inputs and run init again before \
calculating a new Hamiltonian. brokenSymmetryInitRules gives the retained \
subgroup and the resulting Wyckoff positions. Inspect these rules and pass \
them to init@@rules. The symmetry is set by init, not by a symmetryset option \
in symham.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"d2eff576-88e9-41d7-ba9c-daf119988231"]
}, Open  ]],

